# The Vercel CLI only reads the root .gitignore/.vercelignore, not nested
# ones — mobile/.gitignore excludes its own build output from git, but
# without this file the CLI still uploaded ~3GB of Flutter build artifacts
# (mobile/build, mobile/.dart_tool) and blew past the 100MB-per-file limit.
# The Flutter app isn't part of this Next.js deployment at all.
mobile/

# The Player app is a separate Flutter project, deployed on its own to play.gameall.co (see player_app/README.md).
player_app/

# Local Supabase CLI state, not needed by the deployed app.
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
